{"id":2235,"date":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:31:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2235"},"modified":"2025-10-02T10:28:04","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T10:28:04","slug":"pink-cardboard-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/pink-cardboard-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Pink Cardboard Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Pink Packaging for Retail and Gift Purposes<\/h2>\n<p>Pink cardboard boxes are a strong and stylish way to package products for retail and gifting. At the start of packaging design, many businesses also explore <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/branded-cardboard-boxes\/\">Branded Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong> to keep branding consistent across all box colors. Pink options provide both durability and a premium look for a wide range of industries.<\/p>\n<h3>Why pink boxes stand out for businesses<\/h3>\n<p>Empty pink cardboard boxes are often chosen by bakeries, fashion retailers, and event planners because they combine utility with presentation. With options for lids, magnetic closures, and large formats, these boxes provide a wide variety of uses in both wholesale and retail packaging.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Material and Printing Options<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Category<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Available Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Material<\/td>\n<td>Strong cardboard with reinforced durability<\/td>\n<td>Standard cardboard, corrugated, recycled board<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Printing<\/td>\n<td>High-definition printing for logos &amp; designs<\/td>\n<td>Digital, Offset, Screen, CMYK &amp; PMS options<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Finish<\/td>\n<td>Protective coatings for presentation<\/td>\n<td>Gloss, Matte, Spot UV<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Durability<\/td>\n<td>Supports light to heavy products<\/td>\n<td>Retail, storage, bulk packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Key advantages of pink boxes<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Strong structure supports different products.<\/li>\n<li>Multiple lid options add versatility.<\/li>\n<li>Available in bulk with wholesale pricing.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Large Pink Cardboard Boxes for Bulk Packaging<\/h2>\n<p>Large pink cardboard boxes are ideal for shipping and storage while maintaining a neat branded look. Many businesses that use colorful packaging also rely on <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cardboard-Boxes-By-Functionality\/\">Cardboard Boxes By Functionality<\/a><\/strong> to select the right style for their needs. From retail shipping to special event packaging, large pink shipping boxes provide secure handling and elegant presentation.<\/p>\n<h3>Printing and customization details<\/h3>\n<p>Logos, artwork, and product information can be added through offset and digital printing. Boxes are also available in bulk with gusseted bottoms, inserts, and sturdy side panels. Whether you need pink shipping boxes wholesale or large pink gift boxes with lids, options are available for all industries.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Sizes and Usage Options<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Box Size<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Dimensions<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Best Use<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Small Pink Box<\/td>\n<td>4 x 4 x 3 inches<\/td>\n<td>Jewelry, cosmetics, accessories<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Medium Pink Box<\/td>\n<td>8 x 8 x 6 inches<\/td>\n<td>Bakery items, candles, fashion goods<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Large Pink Shipping Box<\/td>\n<td>14 x 10 x 8 inches<\/td>\n<td>Apparel, bulk retail shipping<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extra Large Pink Box<\/td>\n<td>20 x 16 x 12 inches<\/td>\n<td>Storage, event packaging, gift hampers<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Benefits of large packaging<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Handles bulk products without damage.<\/li>\n<li>Branding stands out with strong colors.<\/li>\n<li>Wholesale rates save cost for businesses.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Eco-Friendly Pink Boxes for Sustainable Brands<\/h2>\n<p>At <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>, we also supply eco-conscious pink cardboard boxes. These are manufactured from recyclable cardboard stocks, making them suitable for businesses that value sustainability. They are both durable and environmentally safe, keeping products secure while reducing waste.<\/p>\n<h3>Why eco-friendly options are in demand<\/h3>\n<p>Pink gift boxes with lids made from FSC-certified materials help businesses attract eco-aware consumers. Many retailers prefer large pink gift boxes with lids for events and promotional campaigns because they combine sustainability with style.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eco-Friendly Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Benefit<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Recyclable Cardboard<\/td>\n<td>Fully recyclable and reusable<\/td>\n<td>Reduces waste and supports green goals<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Biodegradable Materials<\/td>\n<td>Breaks down naturally after disposal<\/td>\n<td>Eco-safe and sustainable<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FSC Certified<\/td>\n<td>Comes from responsibly managed sources<\/td>\n<td>Builds consumer trust and credibility<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Food-Safe Printing<\/td>\n<td>Non-toxic inks and coatings<\/td>\n<td>Safe for bakery and retail use<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Additional benefits of eco packaging<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Environmentally responsible choice.<\/li>\n<li>Builds trust with eco-conscious customers.<\/li>\n<li>Reduces long-term environmental impact.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Pink Gift Boxes with Lids for Events and Retail<\/h2>\n<p>Pink gift boxes with lids are widely used in retail displays, parties, and corporate events. These boxes provide both elegance and security for gifting. They are customizable with embossed logos, foil stamping, and window patching to give an upgraded presentation.<\/p>\n<h3>Why lid-based boxes are popular<\/h3>\n<p>Lid options make it easier to package delicate products like clothing, bakery goods, and cosmetics. Large pink gift boxes with lids are often ordered in wholesale quantities by event planners and retailers for cost savings.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Lid and Design Options<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Lid Style<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Detachable Lids<\/td>\n<td>Classic and easy to remove<\/td>\n<td>Gift items, apparel packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Magnetic Closure Lids<\/td>\n<td>Provides premium feel and security<\/td>\n<td>Luxury products, high-end branding<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Window Lids<\/td>\n<td>Showcases product while keeping it secure<\/td>\n<td>Bakery, accessories, retail displays<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Custom Printed Lids<\/td>\n<td>Logo and artwork printing on lids<\/td>\n<td>Corporate events, personalized packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Key highlights of lid boxes<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple lid styles for branding.<\/li>\n<li>Protective structure for delicate items.<\/li>\n<li>Available in small to large gift box sizes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Bulk Supply and Wholesale Rates for Pink Boxes<\/h2>\n<p>Businesses can order pink cardboard boxes wholesale to reduce per-unit costs and ensure steady supply. These boxes are suitable for storage, delivery, and display, making them an all-in-one solution for packaging requirements.<\/p>\n<h3>Why wholesale makes sense<\/h3>\n<p>Ordering in bulk not only saves money but also ensures consistent quality. Large pink shipping boxes and small pink gift boxes can both be included in bulk orders with flexible customization.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Wholesale and Delivery Options<\/strong><\/p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>Option<\/strong><\/th>\n<th><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Minimum Order Quantity<\/td>\n<td>Starts from 100 units<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standard Production Time<\/td>\n<td>7\u201310 business days<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rush Orders<\/td>\n<td>Available for urgent needs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shipping<\/td>\n<td>Free for wholesale packaging orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h3>Benefits of wholesale<\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Cost-effective packaging solution.<\/li>\n<li>Uniform design and printing in bulk.<\/li>\n<li>Reliable supply for retailers and events.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Pink Cardboard Boxes for Modern Businesses<\/h2>\n<p>Pink cardboard boxes with lids, shipping sizes, and gift-ready styles give businesses packaging that blends durability with branding. From large pink cardboard boxes to pink shipping boxes wholesale, each option is designed to add professional value to your packaging strategy. With strong material choices, multiple sizes, and fast turnaround, they remain a preferred solution for industries worldwide.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes sells pink cardboard boxes at wholesale prices. Our boxes are made from strong materials and come in many different sizes and shapes. We also offer different printing and coating options, like gloss, matte, and spot UV. We offer free design and shipping, and our turnaround times are fast. Order Today!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2337,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[181],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2235","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cardboard-boxes-by-functionality","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\